          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বর্ষা (bôrshā) is Sanskrit varṣā, \"the rains, the rainy season\" (Monier-Williams), from vṛṣ, to rain, the same root as বৃষ্টি, rain."
            }
