          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মুষলধারে (mushôldhāre) joins Sanskrit musala, \"a pestle\", and dhārā, \"a stream, a jet\" (Monier-Williams for both), with the locative ending: rain falling in streams as thick as pestles."
            }
          ]
        },
