          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বজ্রপাত (bôjrôpāt) is Sanskrit vajra-pāta, \"the fall of a thunderbolt, a stroke of lightning\" (Monier-Williams), from বজ্র, thunder, and pāta, a fall."
            }
          ]
        },
