              "text": "ছাওয়া — chhāoyā — \"to spread over; to cover over (of clouds); to thatch\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "দুপুরে আকাশ মেঘে ছেয়ে গেল। dupure ākāsh meghe chheye gelô. At midday clouds spread across the sky."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): সেই আকাশ মেঘে ছেয়ে গেল, sei ākāsh meghe chheye gelô."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mostly in the -এ form with যাওয়া: ছেয়ে যাওয়া, to be covered all over. Also to thatch a roof."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ছাওয়া (chhāoyā) is inherited: CDIAL lists Bengali chāuyā, \"to cover, to thatch\", under Sanskrit chādáyati, \"covers, veils\" (CDIAL 5018), the root of ছই, a boat's hood, as well."
            }
          ]
        },
